<title>UK: One of two Dec 3-5 Brents kept, other clocked.</title>
<headline>One of two Dec 3-5 Brents kept, other clocked.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>One of two Brent blend cargoes nominated loading dates on Monday was kept voluntarily but a second was left unclaimed at the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>BP kept a December 3-5 cargo and Statoil was clocked with a December 3-5 loader, traders said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
